# The DuckDB extensions the lake loads (reckon_data.iceberg.Lake), for the DuckDB of requirements/run.txt and
# dev.txt, on the runners' platform (docs/ci.md#8-pinned-versions). scripts/duckdb-extensions.sh downloads each
# from extensions.duckdb.org/<version>/<platform>/<name>.duckdb_extension.gz before the lake runs, checks its
# SHA-256 before it is unpacked, and the lake then loads only these, with nothing fetched while it runs. iceberg
# needs avro. DuckDB may build an extension again under the same address: then the check fails, and the pin is
# measured again here (sha256sum of the .gz).
